content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Intake Coordinator",
      "description": "Manages animal intake, records, and initial assignments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Animal",
      "description": "Represents an animal in the shelter from different perspectives.",
      "attributes": [
        "Intake Record",
        "Observation Log",
        "Medical Profile"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Intake Record",
      "description": "Document recording the animal's arrival details and initial assessment."
    },
    {
      "name": "Observation Log",
      "description": "Keeps track of daily animal behavior and health observations."
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Profile",
      "description": "Records veterinary history and medical treatments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Shelter Database",
      "description": "Central system storing animal records.",
      "attributes": [
        "Intake Record"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Animal Caretaker",
      "description": "Provides daily care and monitoring of animals.",
      "attributes": [
        "Animal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Animal",
      "description": "A physical animal in the shelter."
    },
    {
      "name": "Care Plan",
      "description": "Plan for daily feeding, exercise, and medical care for an animal."
    },
    {
      "name": "Feeding",
      "description": "Scheduled feeding actions for animals."
    },
    {
      "name": "Medical Review Request",
      "description": "Request from caretakers for veterinary review."
    },
    {
      "name": "Veterinary Technician",
      "description": "Performs health assessments and updates medical profiles."
    },
    {
      "name": "Health Assessment",
      "description": "Evaluation of an animal's health status."
    },
    {
      "name": "Adoption Counselor",
      "description": "Guides adopters through visits and adoption decisions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Adoption Recommendation",
      "description": "Counselor’s recommendation regarding suitability for adoption."
    },
    {
      "name": "Adopter",
      "description": "Person interested in adopting an animal."
    },
    {
      "name": "Visit",
      "description": "Interaction session where adopter meets animals."
    },
    {
      "name": "Adoption",
      "description": "Final adoption transaction linking adopter to an animal."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Adoption": {
      "objects": [
        "Adoption Counselor",
        "Adoption Recommendation",
        "Adopter",
        "Visit",
        "Adoption",
        "Animal"
      ]
    },
    "Animal Intake": {
      "objects": [
        "Intake Coordinator",
        "Shelter Database",
        "Animal",
        "Intake Record"
      ]
    },
    "Animal Care": {
      "objects": [
        "Animal Caretaker",
        "Animal",
        "Feeding",
        "Observation Log"
      ]
    },
    "Medical": {
      "objects": [
        "Veterinary Technician",
        "Animal",
        "Care Plan",
        "Health Assessment",
        "Medical Profile"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Adoption": {
      "derived from": "Adoption Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Adoption Counselor",
        "Adoption Recommendation",
        "Adopter",
        "Visit",
        "Adoption",
        "Adopted Animal"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Animal -> Adopted Animal"
      ]
    },
    "Animal Intake": {
      "derived from": "Animal Intake Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Intake Coordinator",
        "Shelter Database",
        "Stray",
        "Intake Record"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Animal -> Stray"
      ]
    },
    "Animal Care": {
      "derived from": "Animal Care Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Animal Caretaker",
        "Animal",
        "Feeding",
        "Observation Log"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Medical": {
      "derived from": "Medical Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Veterinary Technician",
        "Patient",
        "Care Plan",
        "Health Assessment",
        "Medical Profile"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Animal -> Patient"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
